---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="UMKM Site Builder - Platform Website No-Code UMKM" description="Buat website profesional untuk UMKM Indonesia dalam hitungan menit tanpa koding.">
  <main class="container mx-auto px-4 py-16 md:py-24 max-w-5xl">
    <div class="text-center space-y-6">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary text-xs font-semibold border border-primary/20">
        <span>✨ Platform SaaS Visual Builder UMKM</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-base-content leading-tight">
        Bangun Toko & Website UMKM <br />
        <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 via-indigo-600 to-purple-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
          Cepat, Elegan, dan Tanpa Coding
        </span>
      </h1>

      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-base-content/70 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Solusi no-code terintegrasi dengan sub-domain instan, pembayaran digital, dan template visual modular khusus usaha mikro Indonesia.
      </p>

      <!-- CTA Buttons -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4 pt-4">
        <a
          href="/templates"
          class="btn btn-primary px-8 py-3.5 text-base font-bold shadow-xl shadow-primary/25 rounded-2xl flex items-center gap-2"
        >
          <span>🛍️ Jelajahi Template</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">arrow_forward</span>
        </a>

        <a
          href="/builder/new"
          class="btn btn-outline px-6 py-3.5 rounded-2xl font-semibold flex items-center gap-1.5"
        >
          <span>🎨 Buat Template Baru</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Features Preview Highlights -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 pt-16 text-left">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-base-200/50 border border-base-content/10 shadow-sm space-y-2">
          <div class="text-2xl">⚡</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-base-content">Visual Drag & Edit</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-base-content/70 leading-relaxed">
            Editor modular 3-kolom interaktif dengan preview responsif Desktop & Mobile serta styling instan.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-base-200/50 border border-base-content/10 shadow-sm space-y-2">
          <div class="text-2xl">💳</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-base-content">Pembayaran Terintegrasi</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-base-content/70 leading-relaxed">
            Didukung gateway pembayaran otomatis untuk aktivasi toko dan pembelian template desainer.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-base-200/50 border border-base-content/10 shadow-sm space-y-2">
          <div class="text-2xl">🇮🇩</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-base-content">Khusus UMKM Lokal</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-base-content/70 leading-relaxed">
            7 section standar bisnis lokal: katalog WhatsApp, integrasi maps, testimoni, & FAQ terverifikasi.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
